## 1. Company & Founding Facts
- **Official Brand Name:** Acme Technologies
- **Legal Entity:** Acme Technologies, Inc.
- **Founded:** 2023 in San Francisco, CA
- **Funding / Status:** Series A ($14M led by Premier Capital)
- **Primary Website:** `https://acmetech.com`

