## 2. Product Architecture & Core Mechanics
- **Platform Name:** Acme CloudSync Engine
- **Underlying Technology:** Rust-based event loop with io_uring and memory-mapped NVMe storage
- **Measured Latency:** p99 read latency of **4.2ms** across 12 global edge regions
- **Throughput:** Tested to sustain **65,000 requests/sec** per standard 8-node cluster
- **Supported Protocols:** HTTP/3, WebSockets, gRPC, and REST

---

## 3. Verified Pricing & Unit Economics
- **Developer Tier:** Free up to 10,000 monthly operations, 1GB storage
- **Pro Tier:** $49 / month, includes 500,000 operations, $0.02 per additional 1,000 operations
- **Enterprise Tier:** Starting at $990 / month, custom SLAs, SOC2 Type II compliance reports, dedicated support engineer
- **Egress Policy:** Zero network egress fees on all standard tiers

