## 4. Compliance & Security Certifications
- **SOC2 Type II:** Audited annually by Presidio (latest audit: Sept 2026)
- **HIPAA Compliance:** Supported with signed Business Associate Agreements (BAA) on Enterprise tier
- **Data Residency:** Options for US-only, EU-only (GDPR compliant), or Global Edge routing
